THIRD-PARTY NOTICES
===================

Andruna includes or links the third-party components listed below. Each
entry names the component, its version, its source and its license, followed
by the license text or notice the license requires.

Only permissively licensed components are allowed (ADR 0006): Apache-2.0,
MIT, BSD-2-Clause, BSD-3-Clause, 0BSD, Zlib, ISC and Unicode-3.0. Rust crate
dependencies are checked by `cargo deny check licenses` (deny.toml).

Components
----------

The AOSP components below are compiled by aosp/ (cargo xtask aosp-build)
at tag android-17.0.0_r1 (commits in aosp/aosp.lock), from
https://android.googlesource.com. Nothing built from them ships yet; the
full license texts are added here when they do. Each license file named is
in the fetched project (third_party/aosp/<path>).

- ART (libartbase, libdexfile, libartpalette, runtime headers)
